cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite the associated manuscript, the v0.3.0 synthesis addendum, and the repository archive. License terms are defined in the root LICENSE / LICENSE_EVALUATION_ONLY.txt files. Zenodo identifiers for this repository are repository-archive DOIs, not standalone peer-reviewed article DOIs."
type: software
title: "Socio-Traffic Thermodynamics: Risk-Budgeted Information Release Synthesis Addendum"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yoshimura"
    given-names: "Keiji"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
version: "v0.3.0-synthesis-addendum"
date-released: "2026-05-25"
url: "https://github.com/yokken0907/socio-traffic-thermodynamics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yokken0907/socio-traffic-thermodynamics"
abstract: "Claim-bounded repository package for Socio-Traffic Thermodynamics, including the original reduced stochastic ring-road surrogate and a v0.3.0 synthesis addendum on risk-budgeted information release in finite-capacity toy traffic networks. The package does not claim real-world traffic prediction, traffic-policy validation, deployment readiness, or a universal congestion solution. License terms are given in the root LICENSE files rather than in a standard Creative Commons license field."
keywords:
  - Socio-Traffic Thermodynamics
  - traffic congestion
  - information release
  - finite-capacity networks
  - synchronization risk
  - risk budget
  - toy model
  - claim boundary
references:
